ISSUES TO RESOLVE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ISSUE-001: Missing COVENANT_FLOW.vsm
- Severity: HIGH
- Impact: covenant.vsm cannot load properly
- Options:
  a) Create COVENANT_FLOW.vsm with covenant logic
  b) Remove reference from covenant.vsm
  c) Update reference to point to existing file

ISSUE-002: External references in boot files
- Severity: MEDIUM
- Impact: Boot files are not self-contained
- Options:
  a) Move referenced files to boot/
  b) Create symlinks
  c) Keep as-is (distributed architecture)

ISSUE-003: Duplicate R7 definition
- Severity: LOW
- Impact: Potential confusion
- Options:
  a) Remove old definition
  b) Keep both with version markers
  c) Merge into single definition

